Knight of Xoroth.descriptionEn:
Consumes 1 Demonfire
You open a Hellgate for 20 seconds. While within 8 yd of it you take 5% reduced damage and may generate a stack of Demonfire when you take damage.
@All threat generated by the Hellgate is redirected to you.@

